sequenceDiagram
    participant Coord as Transient Coordinator (Node A)
    participant Neighbors as Neighbor Nodes
    participant FedAvg as FederatedAveraging::fed_avg
    participant Peers as All Cluster Peers

    Note over Coord,Neighbors: 1. Heartbeat Quorum Consensus
    Coord->>Neighbors: /lead.Lead/Heartbeat(ready, version)
    Neighbors-->>Coord: BoolMsg { update_ready: true }
    Coord->>Coord: >= 90% quorum reached + has local update

    Note over Coord,Neighbors: 2. Model Gathering
    Coord->>Neighbors: /lead.Lead/RequestModel(coordinator)
    Neighbors-->>Coord: ModelParams { version, model_data }

    Note over Coord,FedAvg: 3. Federated Model Averaging
    Coord->>FedAvg: fed_avg(collected_models, next_version)
    FedAvg-->>Coord: global_model

    Note over Coord,Peers: 4. Global Broadcast & Activation
    Coord->>Peers: /lead.Lead/PushModel(global_model)
    Peers-->>Coord: BoolMsg { ok: true }
    Coord->>Coord: activate(global_model)
    Coord->>Coord: migrate_keys_for_new_model()
    Coord->>Coord: reset_drift_state()
